#
# Vtable for ECMWF IFS 0.25-degree open data (GRIB2, data.ecmwf.int).
# Atmosphere + surface only. IFS open data encodes soil (sot/vsw) on GRIB2
# level type 151 ("soil level"), which WPS 4.3 ungrib cannot read — soil,
# LANDSEA and SOILHGT come from a same-cycle GFS subset instead (see
# fetch_gfs_soil.sh), ungribbed with Vtable.GFS under the SOIL prefix.
# RH at 2 m is derived by ungrib from TT + DEWPT (rrpr.F compute_rh_dewpt).
